        <mxCell id="p3-boundary" value="&lt;b&gt;Exact endpoint boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The scoped serverless delivery role has no Image Builder, EC2 endpoint, or SSM managed-node lifecycle. No Windows image/instance identity exists. No physical Mac + MDM asset or approved EC2 Mac policy/budget exists. Application E2E PASS and Slack source scripts do not prove OS/browser/EDR/VPN posture, consultant access, enrollment, cleanup, or teardown." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;fontColor=#7F1D1D;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;" vertex="1" parent="p3-cloud">
